(3) $\frac{b - a}{4}\pi + \frac{2(a - b)}{\pi} \sum_{n=1}^{\infty} \frac{\cos(2n - 1)x}{(2n - 1)^2} + (a + b) \sum_{n=1}^{\infty} (-1)^{n+1} \frac{\sin nx}{n}$.

